        {
          "text": "ULameka wasesithi kubafazi bakhe: UAda loSila, Zwanini ilizwi lami! Madodakazi akwaLameka, lalelani izwi lami, ngoba ngibulale indoda ngenxeba lami nensizwa ngokulimala kwami.",
