        },
        {
          "text": "U-Adamu wabuye wamazi umkakhe; wazala indodana, wayiqamba igama lokuthi uSeti. Ngokuba uNkulunkulu, wathi, ungimisele enye inzalo esikhundleni sika-Abela owabulala uKhayini.",
